# Artifacts deliberately absent from llms.txt, each with a reason.
#
# The rule: anything served from this site is indexed in llms.txt (or its
# Chinese counterpart llms.zh.txt), or it is listed here. Silence is not an
# option -- an unindexed page is invisible to an agent handed the index, and
# that breaks the contract llms.txt makes.
#
# Format: <glob>  # reason
# Checked by scripts/check_index.py, enforced in CI.
#
# Language is declared in .llms-i18n, not here. A page is never excluded for
# being written in Chinese: `research/wave-backprop.html` used to be listed here
# as a "Chinese-language duplicate", which was wrong -- it is the zh alternate of
# the wave-backprop-en archive notice, and now lives at wave-backprop-en.zh.html.

README.md                              # repo housekeeping, not a publication
*_draft.md                             # superseded drafts of the essay; the PDF is the published form
agent/index.html                       # PWA application shell, not prose
research/sleep-wave-theory.md          # markdown source of sleep-learning-wave-theory.html
theory/abundant-verification-needs-abundant-claims.md    # markdown source of /abundant-verification-needs-abundant-claims.html, which is the indexed reading surface; kept served at its original URL so links already handed out do not 404, and still inlined verbatim into both llms-full bundles
theory/abundant-verification-needs-abundant-claims.zh.md # markdown source of /abundant-verification-needs-abundant-claims.zh.html; same reason
research/papers/SUBMISSION_GUIDE.md    # internal note on journal submission mechanics
ideas/index.html                       # DEAD PATH: the separate repo MachengShen/ideas has its own GitHub Pages site mounted at /ideas/, which shadows this folder entirely. Nothing under ideas/ in this repo is ever served. Kept only so the shadowing is documented rather than rediscovered; new essays go in essays/.
